        "Find the term in $x^{-2}$ in $\\left(\\frac{2}{x} - 3x\\right)^6$:\n$$2r - 6 = -2 \\implies 2r = 4 \\implies r = 2$$\n$$\\text{Coefficient of } x^{-2} = \\binom{6}{2}2^{6-2}(-3)^2 = 15 \\times 16 \\times 9 = 2160$$",
